ace;font-size:13.8666667938232px;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(147,15,128)\"><br></span></pre>or<pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8666667938232px;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(147,15,128)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8666667938232px;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all\"><font color=\"#930f80\">indices&lt;-filter(df, Name ==&quot;Emili&quot;)</font></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8666667938232px;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all\"><font color=\"#930f80\"><br></font></pre>Both commands return <b>indices</b> as <b>integer(empty)</b><br><br><br>What is wrong?<br><br><br>Regards<br><br><br></pre></div></div>"
